///|
/// The butterfly of the radix 16 stage of the prime factor
/// transform, for the twist 1.
///
/// This is the small transform of the original, `Pfacc.pfa16`,
/// with the twist 1.  Its constants are solved in double
/// precision, see `tools/solve_constants.py`.

///|
fn stage_r16_mu1(
  m : Int32,
  kfac : Int32,
  re : Array[Double],
